  "id": "forensic-assessment",
  "term": "forensic assessment",
  "definition": "Forensic assessment, in this source, refers to a pre-trial evaluation documented in a formal report and used in forensic psychiatry to examine social and psychological factors in people involved in serious violent offences. These reports can be analyzed to compare motives and mental features across cases.",
